Inspiration and attribution
---------------------------
This project was inspired by the open-source prototype
"multi-agent-ecommerce-system" by bcefghj:

    https://github.com/bcefghj/multi-agent-ecommerce-system

That repository was studied as a reference only (see SPEC.md §2 and ADR-0010).
This is a new, independent repository, not a fork. No source code and no
documentation were copied from it. At the time of review the upstream
repository contained no LICENSE file, so it is not treated as redistributable.

Third-party data
----------------
Datasets (for example Amazon Reviews 2023, McAuley Lab) are downloaded by
scripts at build time and are not redistributed in this repository. Their
licenses and terms are recorded in docs/data-card.md.
